of the INA, 8 U.S.C.A. § 1226(a), and the Immigration Judge therefore has
statutory and regulatory authority to consider his request for a bond. The
respondent cites Matter of Q. Li, 29 I&N Dec. 66 (BIA 2025), in support of
his argument. Matter of Q. Li, 29 I&N Dec. at 69, held:
     [A]n applicant for admission who is arrested and detained without a warrant while
